# What SERIAL0, the telemetry link to mavlink-gateway, streams, in messages per second.
#
# The gateway never sends, so it cannot ask for streams the way a ground station does;
# the autopilot has to be told here. ArduPilot 4.7 calls these MAVn_*, where MAV1 is
# the first MAVLink port (SERIAL0); older firmware called them SR0_*.
#
# 10 Hz for the timed samples the gateway stamps messages with, so a 10 Hz gateway
# always has a fresh one:
#   POSITION  GLOBAL_POSITION_INT       EXTRA1  ATTITUDE        EXTRA2  VFR_HUD
#   EXT_STAT  SYS_STATUS, GPS_RAW_INT   EXTRA3  SYSTEM_TIME, BATTERY_STATUS
MAV1_POSITION 10
MAV1_EXTRA1 10
MAV1_EXTRA2 10
MAV1_EXT_STAT 2
MAV1_EXTRA3 2
MAV1_RAW_SENS 0
MAV1_RC_CHAN 0
MAV1_RAW_CTRL 0
MAV1_ADSB 0
